    <extension point="xbmc.python.pluginsource" library="addon.py">
        <provides>video</provides>
    </extension>
    <extension point="xbmc.addon.metadata">
        <summary lang="en">SivaDelight Kodi Addon Repository</summary>
        <description lang="en">
SivaDelight Repository: High-quality addons for the community. 

Support the project:
• International: ko-fi.com/siva2109
• Malaysia/India: Scan the TNG QR on our GitHub page!

Your donations help cover server costs and keep updates free for everyone.
